  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Export Guarantee System</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Exportgarantisystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka och utveckla exportst&#xf6;dsystem i Estland. Projektet best&#xe5;r av 4 moduler: Inst. utveckl., know-how och prod. utveckl., r&#xe5;dgivn vad g&#xe4;ller infosystement och juridiska fr&#xe5;gor. En f&#xf6;rstudie har genomf&#xf6;rts.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to strenghten and develop export promotion in Estonia. the project consists of 4 modules: inst. develop., transfer of know-how and product develop., advise on the info system and legal matters. A feasibility study has been carried out.</narrative>
  </description>
